# Language statistics: report this repository as the hardware design it is.
#
# board/ is a generated Xilinx Vitis workspace (BSP drivers, ELFs, bitstreams,
# HTML reports). Without this it contributes ~17.6 MB of generated C and
# dominates the language bar, hiding the SystemVerilog in rtl/.
board/** linguist-vendored

# Paper artifacts and measurement dumps, not source.
docs/** linguist-documentation
results/** linguist-documentation

# Tool-generated project state.
*.mpf linguist-generated
*.cr.mti linguist-generated
modelsim.ini linguist-generated

# Binary artifacts.
*.bit binary
*.xsa binary
*.elf binary
*.a binary
